# EXPRESS-012 manual requests.
# 1. Start the server: npm run dev:express:12  (starts with notes n1 … n4)
# 2. Click "Send Request" above a request (VS Code extension "REST Client").

@host = http://localhost:3000

### Alice's view (expect 200, n1 n2 n4)
GET {{host}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer token-alice

### Bob's view (expect 200, n2 n3 n4)
GET {{host}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer token-bob

### Admin's view (expect 200, n1 n2 n3 n4)
GET {{host}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer token-root

### Bob reads Alice's team note (expect 200)
GET {{host}}/notes/n2
Authorization: Bearer token-bob

### Bob reads Alice's private note (expect 404)
GET {{host}}/notes/n1
Authorization: Bearer token-bob

### Admin reads Alice's private note (expect 200)
GET {{host}}/notes/n1
Authorization: Bearer token-root

### Unknown id (expect 404)
GET {{host}}/notes/xyz
Authorization: Bearer token-alice
